### Detective Control

A detective control was configured to record object access events.

- Enabled **Audit Object Access** within Local Security Policy.
- Configured auditing for delete operations on the LABFILES directory.
- Deleted a test folder to generate an audit event.
- Verified the recorded activity in Event Viewer using Windows Security logs.

