### Directive Control

A directive control was configured to communicate organizational security requirements before user authentication.

- Used Windows PowerShell to configure a legal notice banner through Windows Registry settings.
- Signed out of the workstation.
- Verified that the warning banner appeared before the user could sign in.

**Login warning banner**

![Login warning banner](./images/directive-login-banner.png)

